{
  "dom_id": "step-1022",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Removing a Jump Discontinuity in a Piecewise Radical Function",
  "problem": "Given that the function\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14193886/assets/f72fd02a0488c44ac7472487222507c5739853cd25720502a726844e0c23c915.svg)\nis continuous at $x=0,$ find the value of the constant $b.$",
  "worked_solution": "At $x=0,$ the left-sided limit is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to {0}^{-}}f(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to {0}^{-}}\\sqrt{2b-3x} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2b-3(0)} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2b},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand the right-sided limit is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}f(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}(-x+2) \\\\  & =-(0)+2 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn order for $f(x)$ to be continuous at $x=0,$ we require that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to {0}^{-}}f(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}f(x) \\\\ 2 & =\\sqrt{2b} \\\\ 4 & =2b \\\\ b & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-1022\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"1022\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"263\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-1022\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-5\">Removing a Jump Discontinuity in a Piecewise Radical Function</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"1022\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n           